      "source_span": "source-artifact:c6cb45910a53468aea63b8f43020ebdb/xml:/article/body/sec[2]/sec[1]/p[1];text-sha256:f737194de259e162550e5d55804ed48ae7e060e3c9ac586965c6b1a6f9c9f1c1:4169:4515",
      "sparse_rank": null,
      "text": "We model the observed expression xng of each gene g in each cell n as a sample drawn from a conditional distribution that has a zero-inflated negative binomial (ZINB) form [10, 16, 17] (Online Methods). The distribution is conditioned on the batch annotation bn of each cell (if available), as well as two additional, unobserved random variables.",
